# Collect direction measurements for timeout_sec seconds, average them
# (with outlier rejection), and return a projected waypoint pose.
# The FSM projects: pose.position = drone_pos + avg_dir * distance.

# Goal
float64 timeout_sec
float64 distance 10.0       # metres to project the waypoint along avg_direction
int32 min_measurements 1    # minimum data points required; if not met at timeout, return failure
int32 max_measurements 0    # early-exit: return as soon as this many are collected; 0 = wait for full timeout
---
# Result
bool success
geometry_msgs/Pose pose     # Projected waypoint pose in odom frame
---
# Feedback
int32 measurements_collected
float64 time_remaining_sec
